<div class="modal fade"
     id="hint1"
     tabindex="-1"
     aria-labelledby="hintLabel"
     aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-scrollable modal-lg">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold"
            id="hintLabel">操作提示</h5>
        <button type="button"
                class="btn-close"
                data-bs-dismiss="modal"
                aria-label="關閉"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        {{>common-notes01}}

        <p>
          <button class="btn btn-primary"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#ifo-search"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="ifo-search">
            補撥資料 查詢 ▼
          </button>
        </p>
        <div class="collapse mb-3"
             id="ifo-search">
          <div class="card card-body">
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">1</span> 請選擇 [日期範圍]，無輸入則只抓 7 天內的資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">2</span> 請選擇 [撥補門市]，無輸入則抓取全部門市資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">3</span> 選擇完畢後，按下按鈕［查詢］，即可列出門市撥補單據</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">4</span> 欲察看單據明細，請點擊單據編號，即會開啟</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-info text-black">注意</span> 查詢資料區間越長，花費時間越久</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          <button class="btn btn-success"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#ifo-exportToExcelOrder"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="ifo-exportToExcelOrder">
            匯出 列印用 撥補單 ▼
          </button>
        </p>
        <div class="collapse mb-3"
             id="ifo-exportToExcelOrder">
          <div class="card card-body">
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">1</span> 先執行 <span class="fs-6 badge bg-primary py-2"> 查詢 </span>
            </p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">2</span> 在欄位「匯出 撥補單」按下對應的 [列印用] 按鈕，即可導出列印用EXCELE檔</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          <button class="btn btn-success"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#ifo-exportToExcelOrderOut"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="ifo-exportToExcelOrderOut">
            匯出 列印用 出貨單 ▼
          </button>
        </p>
        <div class="collapse mb-3"
             id="ifo-exportToExcelOrderOut">
          <div class="card card-body">
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">1</span> 先執行 <span class="fs-6 badge bg-primary py-2"> 查詢 </span>
            </p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">2</span> 在欄位「匯出 出貨單」按下對應的 [列印用] 按鈕，即可導出列印用EXCELE檔</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          <button class="btn btn-success"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#ifo-exportToExcelOrderOutERP"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="ifo-exportToExcelOrderOutERP">
            匯出 ERP匯入用 出貨單 ▼
          </button>
        </p>
        <div class="collapse mb-3"
             id="ifo-exportToExcelOrderOutERP">
          <div class="card card-body">
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">1</span> 先執行 <span class="fs-6 badge bg-primary py-2"> 查詢 </span>
            </p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">2</span> 在欄位「匯出 出貨單」按下對應的 [ERP匯入] 按鈕，即可導出ERP匯入用EXCELE檔</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        {{>common-notes02}}

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>